# 2026-06: in-app AI translator runtime artefacts
# Never commit secrets or per-call usage logs — secrets only live in the
# shinyapps.io env-var dashboard; the usage log lives ephemerally in the
# container's working dir.
.Renviron
.env
*.env
translator_usage_log.csv
translator_history_*.json
auth_tokens.csv

# 2026-06: repo tidy-up. Review-cycle artefacts, real-country test data,
# IPCC source PDFs (copyrighted), one-off debug scripts, and build
# outputs in the repo root all stay LOCAL but never enter the public
# repo. The canonical built docs live in www/ and are tracked there.

# Reviewer cycle (Andreas, etc.). NOTE: gitignore patterns do NOT use
# shell-style quotes — spaces in filenames are matched directly, quotes
# would become literal characters and never match anything.
AW_review_response*
AW_final_comments_tracker.docx
Andreas comments on uncertainty calculator*.docx
GHG UNC tool test runs*.docx
feedback on partial test of*.docx
beta_feedback_template_aw.xlsx
correlation_review_notes.md
Suggested outline for final section on reporting.docx
UNC tool methodology text aw_reviewed.pdf
RE_ Emission Calculator*.zip
email_to_andreas.md
docs/AW_review_response*.md
docs/meeting_*_todo.md

